          "content": {
            "id": "b2ccfc14-e0dd-38f3-8909-06b0ceb27e0e",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Trump\u2019s Media Company Gets Into Prediction Markets",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "President Trump\u2019s media business said Tuesday that it will introduce prediction markets on Truth Social through a partnership with Crypto.com, marking his family\u2019s latest expansion into the market for digital assets.  Trump Media & Technology Group said Truth Social users will be able to trade contracts on the outcomes of everything from political elections, interest and inflation rate changes to events across all major sports leagues, using a new technology powered by Crypto.com\u2019s licensed U.S. derivatives exchange.  The collaboration deepens the relationship between Trump Media and Crypto.com.",
